{"articleNo":"43169","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=43169&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학원]2012년 보훈장학금 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.03.13","hit":"7581","attachments":[{"name":"보훈장학신청서(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=43169&attachNo=2196"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#000080\" height=\"47\" valign=\"center\" width=\"605\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY견고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; COLOR: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">2012년 보훈장학금 신청 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">대학원에 재학 중인 국가유공자/특수임무유공자 및 5？18</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">민주유공자를 대상으로 다음과 같이 보훈장학금을 지원하오니 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">□ 대학원 장학생 선발기준</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">ㅇ 대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 상 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">교육지원대상자로서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">대학원에 재학중인</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국가유공자 본인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 순직/전몰 사망자의 배우자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 고엽제후유의증환자(수당지급대상자 본인)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 5.18민주유공자 본인, 사망 또는 행방불명자의 배우자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 특수임무유공자 본인, 사망 또는 행방불명자의 배우자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">무공？보국수훈자 등은 생활등급(최근3년이내 6등급 이하)에 해당되는 경우</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">ㅇ 신 청 자 격</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 대학원 석/박사과정 재학자(연구과정은 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 직전학기 성적 90점 이상자(신입생은 성적 적용 안함) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '궁서'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">※ 신청자가 지급목표 인원보다 많을 경우에는 예산 범위 내에서 선발하여 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -115.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 115.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '궁서'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;되므로 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '궁서'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">탈락할 수도 있음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">□ 신청서 접수기간, 접수처 및 제출서류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">ㅇ 접수기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012년 4월 2일(월) ～ 4월 13일(금)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -91.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 91.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;ㅇ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">접 수 처 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">재학하고 있는 학교 소재지 관할 보훈청 보훈과(방문 또는 우편송부)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -91.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 91.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 대구지방보훈청 주소 : (705-706) 대구 남구 대명로 217&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;ㅇ 제출서류 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -2.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">보훈장학생 신청서 1부</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -2.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> {보훈청 비치 및 국가보훈처 홈페이지 게시},</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">재학증명서 1부,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">직전학기 성적증명서 1부</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(신입생은 제출 생</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">략)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">등록금 납부 영수증 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -92.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 92.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;소득 및 재산을 확인할 수 있는 자료 또는 정보제공 동의서 1부(5.18유공자, 특수임무유공자)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">□ 장학금 지급액 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">115만원(대학원)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -22.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 22.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">□ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">기타 문의사항은 대구지방보훈청 보훈과(☎053-659-6087)로 문의바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -22.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 22.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 80%; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 80%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2012년&nbsp;&nbsp; 3월&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 일</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">대 구 지 방 보 훈 청 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
